  "asof": "2026-10-31 19:50 UTC",
  "headline": "October ends with the Nasdaq down 2.9% and Intel down 29% \u2014 and this book was flat through it",
  "standfirst": "The Nasdaq fell 2.86% and the S&P 1.82% as Intel lost 28.58% on its guide and the semiconductor index fell 7.20%; the Nasdaq finished October about 5.3% lower. Gold fell 3.62% as Fed officials pushed for more hikes, while WTI rose 2.08% to $104.12 after a limpet-mine attack on a tanker. The VIX rose 12.91% to 19.42. The book is flat after GOOG's exit at Thursday's open; Q4 is -7.54 realised, heat 0R.",
  "themes": [
   {
    "kicker": "What's next",
    "right": "Monday: Palantir \u00b7 Tuesday: the midterms",
