    "note": "<b>Monday brings Palantir's Q3</b>, the first AI software result after a week in which the market marked down Alphabet, Intel and the chip sector. <b>Tuesday is the midterm vote</b>, the date that reported US strike plans on Iran have been tied to. The Fed meets on <b>8-9 December</b>."
